&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hey there! &lt;br&gt;We’re &lt;a href=&quot;https://feverup.com/&quot;&gt;Fever&lt;/a&gt;, the world’s leading tech platform for culture and live entertainment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission? To democratize access to culture and entertainment. With our proprietary cutting-edge technology and data-driven approach, we’re revolutionizing the way people engage with live entertainment. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every month, our platform inspires over 300 million people in +55 countries (and counting) to discover unforgettable experiences while also empowering event creators with our data and technology, helping them scale, innovate, and enhance their events to reach new audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our results? We’ve teamed up with major industry leaders like Netflix, F.C. Barcelona, and Primavera Sound, presented international award-winning experiences, and are backed by several leading global investors! Impressive, right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To achieve our mission, we are looking for bar-raisers with a hands-on mindset who are eager to help shape the future of entertainment!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to be part of the experience?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, let’s discuss this role and what you will do to help achieve Fever’s mission.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fever is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Venue Manager&lt;/strong&gt; for the launch of our newest immersive experience in Singapore. We may hire full time or part time for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unlike traditional entertainment, our interactive experiences utilize technology and innovative thinking to create something considered by some as a show in itself. You will run and manage our the venue as an independent operator on-site, with the potential to eventually oversee other growing attractions in our local portfolio as our presence scales. We are looking for a highly self-motivated leader who is passionate about live entertainment, comfortable working autonomously, and dedicated to making our experiences unforgettable for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Venue Manager is responsible for ensuring a high level of service to every guest that walks through our doors, taking full personal ownership of the live experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for independent on-site operations, managing basic local scheduling, ensuring health and safety guidelines are followed, and keeping the upkeep/maintenance of the attraction and the building itself to a premium standard at all times.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Venue Manager must be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary duty manager and solo operator for the building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work highly independently, taking full ownership of the end-to-end guest journey&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote and maintain the highest standard of customer service through direct, high-energy hosting and guest interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Publicly represent our attraction partners and the venue in a prepared and professional manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate practical use of Excel and Word for basic administrative tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be highly confident and competent in the use of basic technology, with the ability to troubleshoot game systems, AV, and tech elements on the spot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support, onboard, and coordinate backup staff or a direct assistant as needed to ensure continuous operational coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake any other daily duties required to ensure the smooth, seamless running of the venue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable with assessing risk and able to manage building safety and security independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable managing local expenses and taking financial responsibility for the day-to-day site budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a highly proactive, hands-on, and self-reliant approach to every working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to coordinate and host live, fast-paced event experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
