&lt;div class=&quot;job-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled Influencer Management Senior Executive to execute influencer campaigns from strategy through performance. This role involves comprehensive planning, negotiation, active campaign management, and providing leadership and quality control for team projects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
