&lt;/div&gt;

mbaexchange-adasia:greenhouse:7745633.descriptionHtml:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As an AI Innovation Intern at AnyMind Thailand, you will be at the forefront of our mission to make business borderless through cutting-edge technology. You will play a vital role in supporting the team by leveraging Generative AI tools and automation platforms to enhance creative efficiency and operational workflows. This is a hands-on learning opportunity designed for a tech-savvy individual eager to master prompt engineering and workflow automation (n8n) within a dynamic MarTech environment.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Content Generation:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize generative AI tools to produce high-quality text, images, video, and audio assets that align with specific project briefs and brand guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workflow Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist in building, testing, and maintaining simple automation flows using platforms like &lt;strong&gt;n8n&lt;/strong&gt; to streamline internal processes and campaign delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool Research &amp;amp; Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively research and experiment with emerging AI technologies and platforms to identify new ways to boost team productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Asset Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize and manage digital assets and datasets for AI projects, ensuring all information is structured and easily accessible for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the tracking and analysis of AI initiative outputs, helping to compile data for regular performance reports and internal reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Support: Collaborate with creative and technical departments to provide AI-enhanced support for digital marketing and e-commerce campaigns.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
