&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tech-Savvy &amp;amp; AI Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong passion for the evolving AI landscape and a proactive approach to staying updated with Generative AI trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong logical thinking and the ability to address routine technical tasks systematically.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; A fast learner with a &quot;can-do&quot; attitude, capable of thriving in a high-pressure, fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Good command of both &lt;strong&gt;Thai and English&lt;/strong&gt; to effectively collaborate with local and regional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-Oriented:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized and responsible, with a keen eye for quality and accuracy in AI-generated outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Tool Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Generative AI tools (e.g., ChatGPT, MidJourney, DALL-E, or Stable Diffusion) through personal or university projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Logic:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic understanding of workflow automation logic (experience with tools like &lt;strong&gt;n8n&lt;/strong&gt;, Zapier, or Make is a significant advantage).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prompt Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge of prompt engineering techniques to optimize and refine AI-generated results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Digital Industry Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic understanding of the digital marketing or e-commerce ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love It&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
